 const list=['Mantra: Om Pran Prin Pron Sah Shanaishcharaya Namah, 19,000 repetitions in 40 days (RAS: 23,000 in all).','Donation on Saturday: black sesame, black clothes, urad, mustard oil, iron articles, leather chappals, blanket, buffalo.','Fast on Saturday and hear the Saturday vrata katha; do not wear black clothes on Saturday.','Hanuman puja; worship Lord Shiva and chant Om Namah Shivaya; Mahamrityunjaya japa (or have it done) if suffering greatly.','Offer unboiled milk and water to a Peepal tree on Saturday; mustard-oil lamp before it in the evening.','Rudraksha: 7, 11 and 14-mukhi. Gem: Blue Sapphire only if Saturn is a yogakaraka; otherwise an iron ring.','Dhatura root (jadi) is named in EAR; Shani Yantra / Graha Peeda Nivarak Shani Yantra; black horseshoe at the door.','Avoid meat, liquor and illicit relations; stay active, pray daily, visit temples; serve the poor, the old and workers.'];
