 <p class="w">${ss?`<b>${tx(ss)}.</b> ${tx('The book’s remedies for this period are listed below.')}`:tx('Saturn is not in a Sade Sati, Kantaka or Ashtama position from your Moon today; the list below is for when it is.')} ${tx('The book notes Aquarius, Capricorn and Libra Moon signs feel least ill effect and Cancer the most, and that a benefic, yogakaraka Saturn in a good house gives good results during Sade Sati.')}</p>
